CONCLUSION: over single+double perturbations of {1..13}, all dilated/shifted/length-13 APs, all unions of two APs, and the destroy-the-lonely-point seed (multiples of 14) — smallest M(S) = 1/14 = exactly the tight AP. NO primitive 13-set with M<1/14.
